#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-neo-v2-pro.rst:7
#: 4cda09b1360b4342a2616e933d030745
msgid ""
"NEO V2 pro is DroneCAN standard GPS developed by CUAV. It integrates "
"industrial-grade compass, barometer, autopilot status light, buzzer, and "
"safety switch all in one package. It has the characteristics of high safety "
"and strong interference resistance."
msgstr ""
"NEO V2 Pro 是 CUAV 开发的 DroneCAN 标准 "
"GPS。它将工业级罗盘、气压计、飞控状态灯、蜂鸣器和安全开关集成在一个包装中。具有高安全性和强抗干扰性的特点。"

